            </note>
            <note corresp="#d262-f2" n="16" xml:id="d262-f2-content">
                <p>See telegrams 385, July 27, 10 a.m., and 286, July 27, from Sofia, <ref
                        target="frus1945Berlinv02#pg_722">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Conference of Berlin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Potsdam</hi>), vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, pp. 722</ref>
                    and <ref target="frus1945Berlinv02#pg_724">724</ref>, respectively.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
